<title>USA: VASCO says gets loan from Belgian bank.</title>
<headline>VASCO says gets loan from Belgian bank.</headline>
<dateline>LOMBARD, Ill. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>VASCO Corp said it received a $2.5 million bridge loan from Generale Bank, Brussels.</p>
<p>The new facility is intended to finance operational activities, said the computer security technology firm.</p>
<p>The loan is in the form of a convertible note at 3.25 percent, VASCO said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
